## 35. Key Relationship Model

## Refrigerator

```text
Refrigerator
│
├── located_in → Kitchen
├── owned_by → Household
├── purchased_from → Costco
├── purchase_price → $1,899
├── paid_from → Credit Card       (populated via §25, not entered manually)
├── receipt → Document
├── warranty → Document
├── manual → Document
└── contains → (a Container, not a food-tracking system)
```

Features should share entities rather than maintain duplicate domain-specific records.

