## 36. Privacy & Permissions

- **Household Admin** — full management.
- **Member** — access per household permissions; **defaults to inventory-visible, finance-invisible**, not an all-or-nothing toggle.
- **Managed Profile** — no independent access; never exposes other family members' data, even after later linking to a real account.

A household member must not automatically gain financial access merely because they can see shared inventory — enforce this at the data layer before transaction-linking ships, not as a UI setting added later.

**Highest-sensitivity data:** photos of home-systems locations (electrical panel, router, valuables) are the most sensitive category in the product. Prefer on-device classification or explicit, clearly-worded opt-in before syncing these to a cloud vision pipeline by default.

