## 37. Success Metrics

### Onboarding
Completion rate · median duration (target: under 2 minutes to first search result) · first scan completion.

### Activation
Primary: user successfully adds at least one AI-recognized object. Secondary: first successful search, first finance connection, first transaction-item link, first finance-triggered capture accepted, first appliance, first document.

### AI Quality
Object acceptance rate · correction rate · deletion-after-recognition rate · classification confidence · location correction rate.

### Core Loop Health (new)
Finance-triggered capture prompt acceptance rate — the clearest signal of whether §26 is actually working as a retention mechanism.

